diff --git a/features/managing-todos.feature b/features/managing-todos.feature
index 2a18a15..a884299 100644
--- a/features/managing-todos.feature
+++ b/features/managing-todos.feature
@@ -81,6 +81,26 @@ Feature: Managing todos
     Given the todo list contains an active todo "Buy milk"
     Then the clear completed control is hidden
 
+  Scenario: Completing a todo updates its existing row in place
+    Given the todo list contains active todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    And the visitor notes the row for "Walk the dog"
+    When the visitor completes "Walk the dog"
+    Then "Walk the dog" is marked completed
+    And the row for "Walk the dog" is the same row element the visitor noted
+
+  Scenario: Marking all as complete updates the existing rows in place
+    Given the todo list contains active todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    And the visitor notes the row for "Buy milk"
+    When the visitor marks all todos as complete
+    Then "Buy milk" is marked completed
+    And the row for "Buy milk" is the same row element the visitor noted
+
+  Scenario: While a todo is being edited its toggle and destroy controls are hidden
+    Given the todo list contains an active todo "Buy milk"
+    When the visitor starts editing "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle control for "Buy milk" is hidden
+    And the destroy control for "Buy milk" is hidden
+
   @captain
   Scenario: A key other than Enter in the new todo field adds nothing
     When the visitor types "Buy milk" in the new todo field and presses "a"
